{"id":"e18594e1037dd7cd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-exchange.md","title":"Exchange","display":"df-exchange — Exchange","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-exchange","aliases":["72-df-exchange"],"display":"df-exchange — Exchange","depends_on":["[[72-df-sequence-sequent]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23","source_statement_checked":true,"verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-exchange"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-exchange</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exchange — Exchange"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter I, section 1.2.2, printed p.11, PDF p.23"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local typed rule-relation or compatibility-alias construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" href=\"?note=c9f8d8c86ed32f12\" title=\"72-df-sequence-sequent\">72-df-sequence-sequent</a> 的签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>、公式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_\\Sigma\">\\(X_\\Sigma\\)</span>、有限序列上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、相继式集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{SeqOrd}_\\Sigma\\)</span>、串接、相继式箭头及一元实例编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\">\\(A,B\\in X_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。下式以长度为1的前提序列与结论的有序对编码一元推理实例；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}_L,\\operatorname{Exchange}_R,\\operatorname{Exchange}\">\\(\\operatorname{Exchange}_L,\\operatorname{Exchange}_R,\\operatorname{Exchange}\\)</span> 只在这一固定签名内使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma&#39;)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma&#39;)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta\n\\right):\nA,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma&#39;)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta,\n(\\Gamma\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Gamma&#39;)\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma\\Delta\n\\right):\nA,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Gamma&#39;,\\Delta\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\Delta&#39;),\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Delta&#39;)\n\\right):\nA,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exchange}_R\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\n\\operatorname{UInf}_\\Sigma\\!\\left(\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\Delta&#39;),\n\\Gamma\\Rightarrow^{\\mathrm{seq}}_\\Sigma(\\Delta\\frown\\langle B\\rangle\\frown\\langle A\\rangle\\frown\\Delta&#39;)\n\\right):\nA,B\\in X_\\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Delta&#39;\\in\\operatorname{CtxSeq}_\\Sigma\n\\right\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exchange}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exchange}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Exchange}_L\\cup\\operatorname{Exchange}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：第 I 章 §1.2.2，印刷 p.11 / PDF p.23。两个关系交换某一侧相邻的公式出现，其余上下文按位置保持。A=B 时实例允许前提和结论相同；这不是定义失效。交换的逆仍为交换实例，因此两个方向均在同一关系中。</p>\n<p>这里必须使用有序序列；对集合或多重集，交换会被上下文相等吸收。定义只构造 SeqRuleSpace_Σ 中的推理实例集，不把演算的推理关系等同于材料蕴涵。</p>\n","